        </p>
        <div class="refs-link">philschmid.de <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div>
      </a>

      <a class="refs-block" href="https://langfuse.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
        <span>Platform</span>
        <h3>Langfuse</h3>
        <p>
          Open-source LLM engineering platform for traces, evaluations, prompt
